<title>JAPAN: Japan Sept platinum imports up 14.9 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Sept platinum imports up 14.9 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's platinum imports in September were up 14.9 percent from a year earlier, Finance Ministry data released on Tuesday showed.</p>
<p>The figures were as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>		    Sept 96	 Aug 96	 Sept 95</p>
<p> Total	    5.62	    4.61	    4.89</p>
<p> Major suppliers:</p>
<p> Russia	   2.05	    1.31	    1.68</p>
<p> South Africa   2.26	    2.40	    2.36</p>
<p>Imports in the first nine months of 1996 were 52.19 tonnes, against 52.79 tonnes in the same period a year earlier.</p>
<p>--Tokyo Commodities Desk (81-3 3432 7431)</p>
</text>
